sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Driver
    participant UI as Kiosk Browser
    participant Avatar as AvatarController
    participant MW as Middleware STT/TTS
    participant EL as ElevenLabs
    participant NLU as NLU Service
    participant SM as Kiosk State Machine

    Note over UI,SM: After session.update with new prompt and speech fields

    UI->>Avatar: setState listening
    UI->>+MW: POST /tts text speech lang
    MW->>EL: synthesize eleven_v3
    EL-->>MW: MP3 audio
    MW-->>-UI: audio bytes cached in Redis

    UI->>Avatar: playWavAndLipSync — setState talking
    Avatar->>Avatar: Web Audio RMS drives mouthOpen
    Avatar->>Avatar: onended — setState idle or listening

    Driver->>UI: Hold record button
    UI->>UI: MediaRecorder capture webm
    UI->>+MW: POST /stt multipart audio
    MW->>EL: speech-to-text scribe_v2
    EL-->>MW: transcript text
    MW->>+NLU: interpret yes no digits
    NLU-->>-MW: normalized + digits
    MW-->>-UI: SttResult JSON

    UI->>+SM: session.input via Socket.io
    SM->>SM: handleInput transition
    SM-->>-UI: session.update new prompt + speech
